cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dashboard, please cite DLBreach (Wu 2013, 2016), the
  probabilistic method it implements (Palmen and Kent 2024), and this
  software, as below.
title: DLBreach Dashboard
abstract: >-
  An interactive Monte Carlo companion to a physically based dam breach
  algorithm: a Streamlit interface to the DLBreach model of Prof. Weiming Wu
  (Clarkson University), with structured input in practitioner units,
  sensitivity scenarios, Monte Carlo ensembles, comparison with measured
  failures of water-retaining dams, and report export.
